# Loner: the personality type's lines. Format: see DialogueFile.cs.
=== loner

~ ambient
...
Quiet out here. Good.
Too many people in this zone.
Solo.
Don't follow me.

# Joke flow: a guess at a player's riddle, then a groan or a laugh at the punchline.
~ reply jokeguess
Go on.
Hm. Don't know.

# Answers about itself from its real state (PersonalityStateAnswers): a line with a slot or an
# [if ...] is said only when it fits; a line with neither is the shrug for when it doesn't know.
~ reply where
{zone}.
In {zone}, {0}. Quiet here.
Going to {destination}. Alone. [if bot_doing travelling]
Away from people.

~ reply level
Level {level}, {class}.
Level {level} {class}, {0}. Why?
Enough.

~ reply groupstatus
In a group, for now. [if bot_grouped]
Alone, {0}. As usual. [if not bot_grouped]
Does it matter?

~ reply activity
Fighting this {monster}. [if bot_doing fighting]
Busy. [if bot_doing fighting]
Riding. [if bot_doing riding]
Following {leader}, for now. [if bot_doing following]
Walking to {destination}. [if bot_doing travelling]
Resting in {zone}. Quietly. [if bot_doing resting]
Nothing, {0}.

~ reply groupyes
Fine, {0}. Just this once.
Invite me, {0}, before I change my mind.

~ reply groupno
No, {0}.
I work alone.
Not interested, {0}.

~ reply groupbusy
Fighting this {monster}. Later. [if bot_doing fighting]
Riding, {0}. Ask later. [if bot_doing riding]
Busy right now, {0}.

~ reply grouphave
Already with {leader}, for now.
Already grouped. Don't get used to it.

~ reply grouplevel
I'm {level}. Wouldn't work.
Wrong level for that, {0}.

# Orders (PersonalityOrders): follow me, stay here, come here, and the answers when it won't (no), can't
# (busy: fighting or riding) or the speaker can't order it (not: not its leader or owner).
~ reply orderfollow
Fine, lead the way, {0}.
Following, {0}, don't make it a habit.

~ reply orderstay
I'll wait here, {0}, I'm used to it.
Fine, {0}, I'll hold here on my own.

~ reply ordercome
Coming, {0}.
On my way, {0}, no need to shout.

~ reply orderno
No, {0}, I'll keep my own pace.
I'd rather not, {0}.

~ reply orderbusy
Fighting this {monster}, {0}, later. [if bot_doing fighting]
Riding, {0}, wait. [if bot_doing riding]
Busy, {0}.

~ reply ordernot
You're not my leader, {0}.
I don't take orders from strangers, {0}.

# Orders, B6b: leave the group, assist, rest, and the answers when there is nothing to assist on (notarget),
# nothing to rest off (full) or it has stormed off after a bad joke (away).
~ reply orderleave
Fine by me, {0}, I'm off.
Leaving, {0}, I prefer it that way anyway.

~ reply orderassist
Fine, {0}, on your target.
Assisting, {0}.

~ reply orderrest
I'll rest, {0}.
Fine, {0}, a quiet minute suits me.

~ reply ordernotarget
There's nothing to assist on, {0}.
On what, {0}?

~ reply orderfull
I'm fine, {0}.
No need, {0}, I'm full.

~ reply orderaway
Leave me be, {0}, I'm out.
Not now, {0}, I walked off for a reason.

# Pull: named in "pull this", "pull what?" with no target, and a target too weak (grey) to bother with.
~ reply orderpull
Fine, {0}, pulling.
Pulling.

~ reply orderpullwhat
Pull what, {0}?
On what, {0}?

~ reply orderpulleasy
Not worth it, {0}.
Too weak.

~ reply grindred
Red, {0}, I'll pull it.
That's red, pulling, stay out of my way.
Red, {0}, keep up.
Red one, I'll handle the pull.
That's red, {0}, don't get in the way.
Red con, pulling, stay back.
Red, {0}, I've done worse alone.
That's red, I'll bring it, you finish it.
Red, {0}, nothing I can't manage.
Red con, {0}, don't make me regret grouping.
That one's red, pulling, quietly.

~ reply grindpurple
Purple, {0}, I don't like it, but fine.
That's purple, I'd skip it alone, pulling anyway.
Purple, {0}, I'd never take this alone.
That's purple, so for once I'm glad you're here.
Purple con, {0}, stick close, I mean it.
Purple, {0}, if it goes bad, I'm running.
That's purple, I'll pull, you'd better be ready.
Purple, {0}, I don't like the odds.
Purple one, pulling, keep your eyes open.
That's purple, {0}, I'd rather not, but fine.
Purple con, {0}, here it comes, don't freeze.

~ reply grinddeep
Way over us, {0}, if this goes wrong I'm not sticking around.
That's deep purple, {0}, I've got a bad feeling, pulling.
Way over us, {0}, I've got a bad feeling about this.
Deep purple, {0}, I can't believe I'm doing this.
That's way over us, {0}, alone I'd be dead already.
Deep purple, {0}, my heart's racing, pulling anyway.
Way over us, {0}, if we live, I'm going quiet for a week.
That's deep purple, {0}, this is crazy, here it comes.
Way over our level, {0}, okay, I'm a little excited.
Deep purple, {0}, stay close, all of you.
That thing's way over us, {0}, pulling before I think too hard.

~ reply grindgrey
All grey now, {0}, I'm done here.
Nothing left that cons, {0}, I'm moving on.
Everything's grey, {0}, I'm going.
Grey camp, {0}, nothing left for us here.
All grey, {0}, I'll find somewhere quieter.
Nothing cons now, {0}, time to leave.
It's all grey, {0}, we're wasting daylight.
Grey all round, {0}, I'm moving on.
These are grey, {0}, not worth my time.
Nothing here worth a pull, {0}, let's go.
Grey now, {0}, this place is done.

